"""Master list of everything a UK aesthetic / skin clinic needs (phase 1), built from official guidance
and wholesaler catalogues. Each row:
 (section, item, specs, clinic, level, sources, kind, frequency, access, mode, regex)
clinic: Both / Aesthetic / Skin.
level : Required = official guidance says the clinic must / should have it
        Recommended = official guidance recommends it (or for higher-risk / enhanced-skill settings)
        If offered = needed only when the clinic offers that treatment (treatment list from DHSC licensing response)
        Standard practice = not named by guidance but stocked by virtually every clinic (seen in wholesaler catalogues)
        Optional
sources: keys of SOURCES below.
kind: Consumable / Medicine / Device / Equipment / Furniture / Fixture / Signage & documents / Service
frequency: Frequent (weekly-monthly reorder) / Periodic (few times a year, expiry-driven) / One-off / Recurring service
access: Public / Professional (verified HCP) / POM (prescription-only medicine)
mode: Compare / Browse / Quote
regex: matched against our listings and against wholesaler category names ('' = not checked automatically).
"""

